# Coloring / KDP paperback product bar

When the owner asks for a new coloring book or similar KDP paperback:

1. **Minimum 70 interior pages** (even). Prefer **~90** when the roster allows
   (more subjects or 2 poses / color+line). Do not ship thin books that only
   meet KDP’s 24-page printer floor.
2. **Same quality bar every time** — detailed clean line art (binarize /
   art-check), solid cover (title, back blurb, barcode pocket; spine text only
   if pages > 79), correct origin blurbs, one-word KDP keywords. What varies is
   **content presentation** (theme, line_only vs color, poses), not quality or
   the page floor.
3. Author content stays in `workspace/` (gitignored). Commit/push **tool + docs**
   only. Full canon: [`docs/COLORING_PRODUCT_BAR.md`](../../docs/COLORING_PRODUCT_BAR.md).
